BEGIN_TEXT
Your station's call and fingerprint, and the card that carries them.
Read the fingerprint to your keymaster by voice or show it in person:
that is how they know the card is yours.

The amateur calls this box answers to are set here too. They are the
amateur world's own: the MARS message center never sends to them, and a
MARS call is never one of them.

Practice (training) checks amateur calls you type but never changes
them: they belong to the whole box, not the practice station.
END
